Translation patch: `From<&[u8]> for Value`

Change: `Value::Bytes(x.into())` becomes `Value::Bytes(x.to_vec())`.
Why: `From<&[T]> for Vec<T>` is not modelled by Aeneas (`<[T]>::to_vec` is).
Behaviour: Identical: std implements `From<&[T]> for Vec<T>` as `to_vec`.

diff --git a/src/value/convert/mod.rs b/src/value/convert/mod.rs
index d051f77..4453000 100644
--- a/src/value/convert/mod.rs
+++ b/src/value/convert/mod.rs
@@ -819,7 +819,7 @@ impl From<bool> for Value {
 
 impl<'a> From<&'a [u8]> for Value {
     fn from(x: &'a [u8]) -> Value {
-        Value::Bytes(x.into())
+        Value::Bytes(x.to_vec())
     }
 }
 
